<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill starts equipment rental cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill starts equipment rental cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it started coverage of U.S. Rentals Inc and Rental Service Corp with near-term accumulate and long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Companies are both in the equipment rental business.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- U.S. Rentals closed at 18-1/2 on Tuesday. Rental Service closed at 18-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
